   Description

   Rivian exists to create products and services that help our planet
   transition to carbon neutral energy and transportation. Rivian designs,
   develops, and manufactures category-defining electric vehicles and
   accessories and sells them directly to customers in the consumer and
   commercial markets. Rivian complements its vehicles with a full suite of
   proprietary, value-added services that address the entire lifecycle of the
   vehicle and deepen its customer relationships.

